{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>美國抵押貸款申請連跌第七個星期。</p><p></p><p>美國截至10月16日的一周，抵押貸款申請按周下跌百分之5.3，跌幅大於前一周的百分之2.7。</p><p></p><p>至於30年期固定抵押貸款利率終止過去八周升勢，略為回落至7.41厘，較前一周低9點子。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T15:22:07.459688+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":107,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T14:47:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T22:17:59.022767+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T15:17:47.126568+00:00","content_hash":"72730c8befd9f07a6524ae1e0f7611e030e6dc8da98bbea142cd07467db39d6d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}